{#-
 Plano de Trabalho Geral e Criterios Tecnicos — doc 27 §4.1

 Um dos cinco planos obrigatorios do Projeto Experimental (RDC 1.014/2026
 Art. 9). Descreve escopo, metodologia, cronograma e criterios tecnicos.

 Contrato de contexto (todas as chaves obrigatorias sob StrictUndefined).
 Providers em src/services/regulatory_documents.build_work_plan_data
 devem preencher todas, mesmo que com listas vazias ou None.

 Chaves esperadas:
  - tenant: dict com id, legal_name, trade_name, cnpj, incorporation_date
  - association: dict com members_count, directive_board (list),
        is_judicial_operation (bool), statute_document_id
  - technical_responsible: dict com full_name, professional_council,
        council_number, council_state (ou None)
  - project: dict com id, title, objective, start_date, end_date, status
  - scope: dict com activities (list de strings)
  - methodology: list de {phase, description, records}
  - quality_criteria: list de strings
  - infrastructure: dict com summary (string), components (list de strings)
  - human_resources: list de {role, count, qualification}
  - scale: dict com members_benefited, production_volume, dispensation_target
  - schedule: list de {phase, start, end, deliverable}
  - interdependencies: list de strings (outros planos referenciados)
  - sops_summary: dict com total (int), by_area (dict area -> count)
  - generated_at: ISO string UTC
  - document_version: 'v1' (do registry)
-#}
